# NOTE: data/lectionary.json and public/readings.json are build outputs but are
# deliberately committed. public/ is the deployable artifact, so keeping them in
# the repo means `wrangler pages deploy public` works on a fresh clone with no
# build step. Regenerate them with `npm run build`.
